  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDLG, WASH Programming</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Years of conflict in South Sudan&apos;s Greater Kapoeta and Torit regions have resulted in the devastation of livelihoods and social services, undermining people&apos;s rights to basic services such as WASH, democracy, safety and economic empowerment, especially for women and youth. This project aims to help build the capacity of local governments to provide basic services, include citizens in decision making and increase private sector participation.</narrative>
  </description>
